{
  "format": "neo-chapter/1",
  "id": "engine-fixture",
  "title": {
    "en": "Exercise engine fixture",
    "es": "Prueba del motor de ejercicios"
  },
  "goal": {
    "statement": {
      "en": "Answer one of every generic exercise type and see the attempt it wrote"
    },
    "evidence": {
      "skill": "fixture.atlas.read",
      "accuracy": 0.8,
      "min": 10,
      "window": 40
    }
  },
  "requires": [],
  "state": "ready",
  "data": [
    "fixtures/data/atlas.json"
  ],
  "rungs": [
    {
      "id": "all-nine",
      "title": {
        "en": "One of each"
      },
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "fx-read",
          "type": "read",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.read",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "read: pages, never graded"
          },
          "pages": [
            {
              "id": "p-intro",
              "kind": "prose",
              "title": {
                "en": "What this exercise is for"
              },
              "body": {
                "en": [
                  "A read exercise turns pages and records that they were turned. It never grades.",
                  "Every attempt it writes carries correct: null, which counts toward nothing, so turning pages cannot pass a chapter."
                ],
                "es": [
                  "Un ejercicio de lectura pasa paginas y registra que fueron pasadas. Nunca califica.",
                  "Cada intento lleva correct: null, que no cuenta para nada, asi que pasar paginas no aprueba un capitulo."
                ]
              },
              "note": {
                "en": "The time on the page is the ms of the attempt."
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "p-table",
              "kind": "table",
              "title": {
                "en": "A table page pointed at data"
              },
              "columns": [
                {
                  "en": "Name",
                  "es": "Nombre"
                },
                {
                  "en": "Code",
                  "es": "Código"
                },
                {
                  "en": "Known as",
                  "es": "Conocido como"
                },
                {
                  "en": "Moons",
                  "es": "Lunas"
                }
              ],
              "items": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
              "fields": [
                "name",
                "code",
                "nick",
                "moons"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "p-callout",
              "kind": "callout",
              "tone": "warn",
              "body": {
                "en": [
                  "A callout carries one point. This one carries the point that nothing on this page knows what it is about."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "p-figure",
              "kind": "figure",
              "title": {
                "en": "A figure page"
              },
              "figure": {
                "kind": "svg",
                "src": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
                "render": "orbit",
                "caption": {
                  "en": "Figures are the shell renderer's job, not the engine's."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fx-choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.recognise",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "choice: which name has this code?"
          },
          "items": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
          "prompt": "code",
          "answer": "name",
          "distractors": {
            "from": "siblings",
            "by": "group",
            "n": 3
          },
          "count": 4,
          "pass": {
            "accuracy": 0.75
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fx-typed",
          "type": "typed",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.produce",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "typed: type the code, lower case is converted as you type"
          },
          "items": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
          "prompt": "name",
          "answer": "code",
          "transform": "demo.upper",
          "compare": "trim",
          "count": 3,
          "pass": {
            "accuracy": 0.66
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fx-typed-accept",
          "type": "typed",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.produce",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "typed, two accepted answers: type the code or the symbol",
            "es": "escrito, dos respuestas aceptadas: escribe el código o el símbolo"
          },
          "items": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
          "prompt": "name",
          "answer": "accept",
          "compare": "trim|casefold",
          "count": 3,
          "pass": {
            "accuracy": 0.66
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fx-match",
          "type": "match",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.recognise",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "match: pair each name with its code"
          },
          "items": "fixtures/data/atlas.json#planets",
          "left": "name",
          "right": "code",
          "n": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "fx-order",
          "type": "order",
          "skill": "fixture.atlas.sequence",
          "itemIdPrefix": "atlas",
          "title": {
            "en": "order: put them in order of distance"
